  "slug": "atmgamma",
  "title_en": "Understanding Near-ATM High Gamma: Where Prices Get Pinned",
  "excerpt_en": "High-gamma strikes near the money—where dealer hedging is densest and expiration pinning shows up.",
  "body_en": "<!-- ===== OptionsAji 博客片段：近 ATM 高 Gamma 榜使用说明 ===== -->\n<style>\n  .aji-guide{--bg:#f5f2f0;--ink:#151617;--gold:#c9a227;--card:#fffdfb;--line:#e7e1d8;--muted:#6f6a63;--soft:#c9c2b6;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;line-height:1.75;font-size:16px;padding:4px}\n  .aji-guide h2{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2px}\n  .aji-guide h3{font-size:18px;margin:26px 0 8px;font-weight:700}\n  .aji-guide p{margin:10px 0}.aji-guide .lead{font-size:17px}\n  .aji-guide .accent{color:var(--gold);font-weight:700}\n  .aji-guide .chart-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:20px 22px;margin:22px 0;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(21,22,23,.05)}\n  .aji-guide .chart-note{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 14px}\n  .aji-guide canvas{max-width:100%}\n  .aji-guide .analogy{border-left:4px solid var(--gold);background:rgba(201,162,39,.07);padding:12px 16px;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;margin:16px 0}\n  .aji-guide .formula{background:#151617;color:#f5f2f0;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;overflow-x:auto}\n  .aji-guide .formula b{color:var(--gold)}\n  .aji-guide .data-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:14px 0;font-size:14.5px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px}\n  .aji-guide .data-table th{background:var(--ink);color:#f5f2f0;text-align:left;padding:11px 14px;font-weight:600}\n  .aji-guide .data-table td{padding:11px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}\n  .aji-guide .data-table tr:nth-child(even) td{background:rgba(201,162,39,.035)}\n  .aji-guide .data-table .col{font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap}\n  .aji-guide .tag{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:20px}\n  .aji-guide .tag-core{background:var(--gold);color:#fff}.aji-guide .tag-base{background:var(--soft);color:var(--ink)}\n  .aji-guide .disclaimer{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:26px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n  .aji-guide .cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--gold);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;padding:11px 20px;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(201,162,39,.3);transition:background .15s}\n  .aji-guide .cta:hover{background:#b8911f}\n  .aji-guide .cta-row{margin:16px 0 4px}\n  .aji-guide .cta-bottom{background:rgba(201,162,39,.08);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;margin:24px 0 8px;text-align:center}\n  .aji-guide .cta-bottom p{margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:700}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aji-guide\">\n  <h2>Understanding Near-ATM High Gamma: Where Prices Get Pinned</h2>\n  <p class=\"lead\">A <span class=\"accent\">refined High Gamma view</span>: only strikes <b>near the money (ATM)</b>. Dealer hedging is densest here—price often gets <b>pinned</b> into expiry.</p>\n  <div class=\"cta-row\"><a class=\"cta\" href=\"https://www.options-aji.com/options/gex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📊 View Near-ATM High Gamma on GEX page →</a></div>\n  <h3>1. Why Filter Near ATM?</h3>\n  <div class=\"analogy\"><p style=\"margin:4px 0\"><b>High Gamma board</b> = fastest delta anywhere.</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0\"><b>Near-ATM High Gamma</b> = strikes <span class=\"accent\">right around spot</span>—densest hedging, most direct spot impact.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"formula\">Filter: |strike − spot| / spot ≤ threshold (e.g. <b>±2%</b>) and top gamma ranks<br>Focus strikes ≈ spot with heavy gamma → potential pin levels</div>\n  <div class=\"chart-card\"><h2 style=\"font-size:18px\">Near-ATM Zone on the Gamma Curve (example)</h2><p class=\"chart-note\">Spot $100. Gold band ($98–$102) is the focus zone. Rendered with Chart.js via jsDelivr CDN only.</p><canvas id=\"natmZone\" width=\"640\" height=\"300\" aria-label=\"Near-ATM gamma zone\"></canvas></div>\n  <h3>2. Pinning: How Price Gets Pulled to a Strike</h3>\n  <p>With <b>positive gamma</b>, dealers <span class=\"accent\">sell rips, buy dips</span>—compressing moves toward heavy-gamma strikes into expiry.</p>\n  <div class=\"formula\">Positive-gamma hedge: stock ↑ → sell stock (cap rally); stock ↓ → buy stock (support) ⇒ pin toward <b>K</b></div>\n  <div class=\"chart-card\"><h2 style=\"font-size:18px\">Price Converging to a Gamma Strike</h2><p class=\"chart-note\">Dashed line = heavy gamma at $100. Into expiry, range compresses toward the pin.</p><canvas id=\"natmPin\" width=\"640\" height=\"280\" aria-label=\"Pinning effect\"></canvas></div>\n  <h3>3. Column Guide</h3>\n  <table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th>Column</th><th>Meaning</th><th>How to use</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">#</td><td>Rank by gamma within near-ATM band.</td><td>Top = likely pin/battle line.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Contract</td><td>Near-spot strike + expiry + side.</td><td>Strike = magnet level.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Gamma <span class=\"tag tag-core\">Core</span></td><td>Delta change rate.</td><td>Direct hedging impact.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Dist to ATM(%) <span class=\"tag tag-core\">Core</span></td><td>Strike vs spot %.</td><td><span class=\"accent\">Closer to 0 → stronger pin</span>.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Delta</td><td>Direction exposure (~±0.5 ATM).</td><td>Current lean.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">DTE</td><td>Days to expiry.</td><td>Lower DTE → stronger pin.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Volume <span class=\"tag tag-base\">Aux</span></td><td>Today's volume.</td><td>Active strikes matter more.</td></tr>\n  </tbody></table>\n  <h3>4. Three Reminders</h3>\n  <p><b>1. Pinning isn't guaranteed</b>—needs positive gamma (see GEX). Negative gamma flips the effect.<br><b>2. Strongest into OpEx.</b><br><b>3. Not a predictor</b>—headline risk breaks pins.</p>\n  <div class=\"cta-bottom\"><p>Ready to explore? See today's live data 👇</p><a class=\"cta\" href=\"https://www.options-aji.com/options/gex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📊 View Near-ATM High Gamma on GEX page →</a></div><p class=\"disclaimer\">Data may be delayed ~15 minutes. For research only—not investment advice. Options trading involves substantial risk of loss. © OptionsAji</p>\n\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.1/dist/chart.umd.min.js\"></script>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  if(typeof Chart==='undefined')return;\n  var GOLD='#c9a227',GOLD_SOFT='rgba(201,162,39,.85)',GRAY='#c9c2b6',INK='#151617';\n  var strikes=['92','94','96','98','100','102','104','106','108'];\n  var g=[0.010,0.020,0.038,0.065,0.082,0.065,0.038,0.020,0.010];\n  var colors=strikes.map(function(s){var d=Math.abs(+s-100);return d<=2?GOLD_SOFT:GRAY;});\n  var c1=document.getElementById('natmZone');\n  if(c1){new Chart(c1,{type:'bar',data:{labels:strikes,datasets:[{label:'Gamma',data:g,backgroundColor:colors,borderRadius:4}]},\n    options:{responsive:true,plugins:{legend:{display:false},tooltip:{callbacks:{title:function(t){return 'Strike $'+t[0].label;},label:function(i){return 'Gamma '+i.parsed.y.toFixed(3)+(Math.abs(+i.label-100)<=2?' (near-ATM)':'');}}}},\n    scales:{x:{title:{display:true,text:'Strike（现价 $100）',color:INK},ticks:{color:INK},grid:{display:false}},y:{ticks:{color:INK},grid:{color:'rgba(21,22,23,.06)'}}}}});}\n  var t=['T-6','T-5','T-4','T-3','T-2','T-1','到期'];var px=[103.2,97.5,101.8,98.6,100.9,99.6,100.1];\n  var pin=t.map(function(){return 100;});\n  var c2=document.getElementById('natmPin');\n  if(c2){new Chart(c2,{type:'line',data:{labels:t,datasets:[\n      {label:'Stock price',data:px,borderColor:GOLD,tension:.3,pointRadius:3,borderWidth:2.5},\n      {label:'Heavy gamma strike $100',data:pin,borderColor:INK,borderDash:[6,5],borderWidth:1.5,pointRadius:0}]},\n    options:{responsive:true,plugins:{legend:{labels:{color:INK,font:{size:13}}},tooltip:{callbacks:{label:function(i){return i.dataset.label+'：$'+i.parsed.y;}}}},\n    scales:{x:{ticks:{color:INK},grid:{display:false}},y:{ticks:{color:INK,callback:function(v){return '$'+v;}},grid:{color:'rgba(21,22,23,.06)'}}}}});}\n})();\n</script>\n<!-- ===== /片段结束 ===== -->"
}
